# Development Flow

## Surfaces

- `platform` — `/auth/platform/login` → `/platform/*`
- `app` — `/:slug/app/*`
- `shop` — `/:slug/shop/*` or `public_domain`
- `investor` — `/:slug/investor/*`

## Naming

- Vue: PascalCase. Stores: `<module>Store.ts`. Repos/services: `<entity>Repository|Service.ts`.
- SQL: snake_case; migrations `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.sql`.
- RPCs: `verb_noun_for_scope`. Routes: scope-prefixed.

## Locked business

- Multi-tenant; stock owned by parent; child via allocations.
- Stock-backed shops sell from `global_stock_allocations` only.
- Sales models BW / pre-order / K-beauty (`koba`) / thrift — do not mix `global_stocks` with `koba_*` or `thrift_*`.
- Investor portal v1 read-only. Commerce legacy → `shop_order`.

## Patterns (pointers only)

- Feedback: `appFeedback.ts`. Images: `SmartImage`. Loading: `GlobalAjaxBar`. Shell themes: `theme-platform|app|shop`.
- Treasury: `TreasuryPageShell` / `TreasuryStatGrid` / `TreasuryTableWrap`.
- Batch costing: `useShipmentItemsCostingCache` — never `listShipmentItems` in loops.
- Large lists: `skip_count: true`. No `backdrop-filter` on static chrome.
- UI canon: `quasar-ui.mdc`. Local DB: `supabase-local-backend.mdc` (`backend:local` default).

## Do not touch without ask

- Generated `database.types.ts` / `supabase.ts`
- Legacy cutover migrations (`20260709000600_b7_cleanup.sql` chain)
